name "Godot 3 to 4 Migration"

target "godot"
ast-set "target"

description r#"Godot 3 to 4 Migration
======================

This example migrates a small Godot 3 project to Godot 4 syntax, letting the target
name each file's language: exported variables become @export annotations
and KinematicBody2D becomes CharacterBody2D, both in scripts and in scenes"#
